  "title": "Consciousness is mental appearance",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "583cc18e-3b07-4aff-bc02-a07a3af29be2",
      "text": "Consciousness is the way one's mental life appears to one. A theory of consciousness explains this subjective appearance, not the mental reality that produces it, and appearance and reality can diverge here as elsewhere.",
